--- Acceptance criteria ---
[x] Surface renders all web states (loading / loaded / empty / error / stale / offline) via SleepEfficiencyViewModel + view.
[x] Hooks bind to the shared P1/S8 state-holder layer (ISleepEfficiencySource -> CacheThenNetworkEngine, IWidgetVehicleSource for primary-vehicle resolution); no HTTP in the view.
[x] Every i18n key from the web source resolves through the P1/S10 facade and exists in the apps/windows/Strings catalog:
    widget.sleepEfficiency.{title,efficiency,avgDrain,totalSleep,hours,wakeEvents,noData} + help.sleepEfficiency.body (verified present in Strings/{en,ar,he}/Resources.resw). Native-only convenience keys (refresh/loading/error/retry/description) carry English fallbacks per the established sibling pattern.
[x] Accessibility labels on the gauge (value+unit+caption measure name), each stat tile, the refresh button, the help tooltip and the loading skeleton (AutomationProperties / LiveRegion).
[x] Tests: parse-adapter unit tests + per-state view-model tests + registration/diagnostics/source + a11y label tests (72 total).
[x] No TODO / stub / mock / placeholder / Lorem in shipped code (PLACEHOLDER_EXIT=0).

--- Parity notes (web SleepEfficiencyWidget.tsx -> native) ---
* Gauge value = sleep_efficiency_pct (clamped 0..100); integer -> 0 dp, fractional -> 2 dp (web RadialGauge Number.isInteger / global precision), small inline "%" suffix, "Efficiency" caption beneath the ring (blanked when compact).
* efficiencyColor: >95 Success(#10B981) / >85 Warning(#F59E0B) / else Danger(#EF4444), strict comparisons, via themed status brushes.
* Stats (only when !compact): Avg Drain/Day = fmtNumber(sentry_off_drain_rate*24, 2) "%"; Total Sleep = fmtNumber(sum(asleep|offline total_minutes)/60, 0) "h"; Wake Events = recent_events.length (no unit).
* Empty surface (Moon glyph + "No sleep efficiency data") when the response body is not an object (web data == null). An object body — even {} — renders the gauge at 0%.
* No useUnits dependency: the web widget formats with plain fmtNumber only (percentage / %-per-day / hours / count are dimensionless), so no unit-preference plumbing is carried (faithful parity).
* Diagnostics emits "view.opened slug=SleepEfficiencyWidget" (P1/S11), PII-safe (no efficiency value / VIN / vehicle id).

